{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36695","headline":"送舒州宿松县傅少府 · 罗隐","name":"送舒州宿松县傅少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江蓠漠漠树重重，东过清淮到宿松。\n县好也知临浣水，官闲应得看灊峰。\n春风绿野吴歌怨，雪霁平郊楚酒浓。\n留取余杯待张翰，明年归棹一从容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}